  m_text: '<b>Characteristic</b> - sparse, thorny vegetation, small trees, and drought-resistant
    plants.

    <b>Rainfall - </b>below 70 cm

    <b>Common Trees - </b>Babool
    tree, Ber tree, wild date palm, Khair tree, Neem tree, Khejri tree, and Palas
    tree

    <b>Common Animals- </b> Camels, Blackbuck, Desert Foxes, and Vultures

    <b>Location
    - </b> Gujarat, Rajasthan, Madhya Pradesh, Chhattisgarh, Uttar Pradesh, Punjab,
    and Haryana.'
