  m_text: "<b>Characteristic</b> - fragile ecosystem, wide variety of plant species\r\n<b>Rainfall
    - </b>100 cm \u2013 300 cm\r\n<b>Common Trees - </b>oak, chestnut, maple, rhododendron\r\n<b>Common
    Animals- </b> Snow Leopard, Red Panda, Himalayan Black Bear, and Yak\r\n<b>Location
    - </b> southern slopes of the Himalayas, Western Ghats and the northeastern hills."
