  m_text: '<b>Characteristic</b> - Leaf Shedding, seasonality

    <b>Rainfall -
    </b>70 cm to 200 cm

    <b>Common Trees - </b>teak, sal, bamboo, shisham, and
    mahua

    <b>Common Animals- </b> Tigers, Leopards, Elephants, Langurs, and
    Deer (like chital and nilgai)

    <b>Location - </b> Madhya Pradesh, Uttar Pradesh,
    Chhattisgarh, Odisha, Maharashtra, Karnataka, and Tamil Nadu

'
