  m_text: '<b>Character -</b> High Rainfall, High Humidity, Stratified vegetation,
    Tall Trees

    <b>Rainfall -</b> over 200 cm annually

    <b>Common Trees -
    </b>rosewood, mahogany, ebony, and bamboo

    <b>Common Animals - </b>Elephant,
    Malabar giant squirrel, Deer, reptiles.

    <b>Location - </b>Western Ghats,
    the Andaman and Nicobar Islands, and the northeastern states

