  m_text: "<b>Characteristic</b> -dense, salt-tolerant trees and shrubs\r\n<b>Rainfall
    - </b>1,000 to 3,000 mm per year.\r\n<b>Common Trees - </b>Avicennia officinalis,
    Rhizophora mucronata, Sonneratia alba, Avicennia alba\r\r\n<b>Common Animals-
    </b> Royal Bengal Tiger, Crocodile, and Herons\r\n<b>Location - </b> Sundarbans
    (West Bengal), Bhitarkanika (Odisha), and the Krishna-Godavari delta"
